Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In RemoteViews, SetCompoundButtonCheckedAction and
SetRadioGroupCheckedAction temporarily clear the checked change
listener on the view to prevent updates from triggering intents.

Previously, this was only done if the listener tag was an instance of
OnCheckedChangeListener. However, if the tag is clobbered to a non-listener
type (e.g. by setting an integer tag), this check was bypassed, meaning
updating the checked state would fire the listener.

Always clear the listener on the view first. Then, restore it only if
the tag is a valid OnCheckedChangeListener.

